# Byte-exact working-tree content.
#
# validation_results/SHA256SUMS binds the archived validation results to the
# code, documentation, and pinned requirements that produced them, and the
# bundled electrode montages are hashed alongside them. Any end-of-line
# translation between the repository and a working tree would change those
# bytes and break the manifest on a platform whose checkout convention differs
# from the one that generated it. Disabling the text filter keeps every file
# identical on every platform.
* -text
